      "id": "n5f6g7h8",
      "title": "HealFast Program Eligibility Criteria",
      "content": "To be eligible for the HealFast program, patients must have completed at least six months in the Path to Wellness program and shown progress in their health metrics. Confidentiality of patient health information must be upheld as per HIPAA regulations."
